  "draft_py": "# Mu Yanling, Sky Dancer (M20). Re-mapped 2026-11-12 (wave 2): the [-8]'s emblem rides its\n# GET_EMBLEM (EmblemSpec, the emblem's abilities; controller YOU, who gets it), so the -8 is no\n# longer an empty emblem.\n# \"[+2]: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gets -2/-0 and loses flying.\" Garruk,\n# Unleashed's loyalty +1 shape (a Seq of MODIFY_PT and a keyword change over one \"up to one target\n# creature\" selector) with Rookie Mistake's \"-2/-0\", Soul Sear's LOSE_ABILITY for \"loses flying\",\n# and DurationUntilNextTurn on both steps (unchanged from the first mapping).\n# \"[-8]: You get an emblem with \"Islands you control have '{T}: Draw a card.'\"\": the emblem's one\n# static ability is Mask of Immolation's granted-activated-ability shape (StaticAbility +\n# GRANT_ABILITY of an ActivatedAbility) over \"Islands you control\" (Dread Presence's \"a Swamp you\n# control\": CONTROLLER_IS YOU, SUBTYPE_EQ, TYPE_EQ Land), the ability {T}: DRAW 1 (Crash Through).\ntarget = Selector(\n    count=QAtMost(n=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nplus_two = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=2),)),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'duration': DurationUntilNextTurn(),\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n                'target': target,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=0)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.LOSE_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n                'duration': DurationUntilNextTurn(),\n                'target': target,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nislands = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Island'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\ntap_draw = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostTap(),)),\n    effect=A(Verb.DRAW, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n)\nemblem = EmblemSpec(\n    abilities=(StaticAbility(effect=A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {'ability': tap_draw, 'target': islands})),),\n)\nminus_eight = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=-8),)),\n    effect=A(Verb.GET_EMBLEM, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'emblem': emblem}),\n)\nminus_three, carrier = compiled\nabilities = [plus_two, minus_three, minus_eight, carrier]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "[+2]: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gets -2/-0 and loses flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−3]: Create a 4/4 blue Elemental Bird creature token with flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−8]: You get an emblem with \"Islands you control have '{T}: Draw a card.'\"",
    "ir": "abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Re-mapped 2026-11-12 for the emblem encoding (GET_EMBLEM carries its EmblemSpec and who gets it): the -8's emblem was empty (GET_EMBLEM {}), it now grants Islands you control '{T}: Draw a card.'. The +2 and -3 are unchanged. G1 starts at loyalty 2, so only the +2 is exercised there; tools/scenarios/mapped/M20/mu_yanling_sky_dancer_emblem_islands_draw.json plays the -8 (the emblem outlives her; only her controller's Islands draw)."
 },
